    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56031" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατολῐγωρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>neglect utterly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δικαίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					9.16
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρός</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				13.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.2a
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				888.153
			</span></i> (Scaptopara, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>to be negligent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς ἀλλοτρίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diogenian.
					2.75
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.426.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατολιγωρήσαντες</span>
			<i>with contempt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1421a15
			</span></i>.</div>
